    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa's exhibition hall is still the same as it was the other day."
    },
    {
        "text": "Shattered glass cases, scorched ground, cracks in the walls; colorful spotlights, wanton graffiti, and frantic music going wild..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything is the same except the additional presence of a big round table in the center of the room."
    },
    {
        "text": "A grill sizzles on the table at the perfect temperature, emanating an enticing aroma."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "48_i12",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.05,
        "yScale": 1.05,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.05,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.05,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "c"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$warm_intro",
        "key": "$warm_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_tdhbdzjczs",
        "volume": 0,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "s"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, why isn't anyone ordering? Not hungry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't expect you to turn the place into a barbecue restaurant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. The building got bombed into a war zone, and the art can't stay here anymore. So I thought, we might as well turn it into a side gig instead of leaving it empty.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "The TV stations in Dossoles lost their money-maker Reynell, so now they've started sticking their noses here and spreading rumors that none of our artists can cook and just survive on dried cactus.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I have to show them what true Bol\u00edvarian cuisine is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, I'll have one of those onion and mushroom meat skewers\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make it two.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Coming right up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm... Mr. Diaz's really good at this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ash"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to be honest, we've traveled all over Terra, but this is the first time we've tasted Bol\u00edvarian BBQ.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where have you all been?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "text": "We started from the Sargonian desert, and after a brief stay on Rhodes Island where we got our 'Team Rainbow' moniker, we each went off to a few more places.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "text": "The rainforests of Sargon, the icefields of Sami, Columbia's mines and cities, villages in the Ursus taiga...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even so, we've only ever set foot on a small piece of these lands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frost"
    },
    {
        "text": "My only regret is burying Levi Klitschko under the sands of Sargon along with his mad lab.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're homesick, you'll have to start thinking of a different way to go back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you found one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Iana"
    },
    {
        "text": "(shrugs) Not even a lead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess you wouldn't mind a few more traveling companions on your quest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Fuze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hahaha. The more the merrier!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tachanka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, Lord, what is that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Doc"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, let me, on behalf of Lord, introduce this 'Ursus Specialty Beverage'\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blitz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "s",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "c",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is a sudden noise outside the window."
    },
    {
        "text": "The members of Team Rainbow turn their heads full of food and drink toward the source of the noise, wondering what kind of trouble has erupted this time\u2014"
    },
    {
        "text": "And then, the first one to realize what is going on shrugs in resignation."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g4_galleriessquare_b",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "style": "slider",
        "inverse": true,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Pap\u00e1 says it's our turn to dance our Vulpo minuet today, so turn off your classical music!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Artist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Tecno says she likes our triple meter waltz! Go and ask her if you don't believe me, she's over by the wall!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Destitute Noble"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_022"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, exactly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Resident"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come over here, Tecno. What do you make of this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Artist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, don't bother me with this kinda stuff!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you can spare the time to argue over what music to play, then maybe take a look at my work!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_498_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your work? But your hand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Community Artist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, just come over and you'll see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
