    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha! I practiced a lot, and I'm finally used to drawing with my left hand\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
